BuildBlockMapModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Builds a block-id to block map and an ordered list of block ids (sequence order) by recursive traversal of the blocks list.
    Provides: BuildBlockMap(blocks, i, m, order) -> res. blocks — IR block list; i — index (0 to start); m — accumulated id-to-block map; order — accumulated id list; returns map {"m":m,"o":order}.
    DependsOn: BuildBlockMap recursion (leaf; Core.MapSet/ListPush/Add).
    Composition: Native Include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../BuildBlockMap/BuildBlockMap.sir).
    Notes: tail recursion over the index; the result feeds state["bm"]/state["order"] at emission.
